[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":14},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"bg023"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",329],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…午休时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原没有来到集合的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（我还以为他会一直陪着风子的…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对他来说，这只是用来打发时间的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他不是会为了这种事情拼命努力的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我明明是知道的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「只剩我们两个人了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「因为风子总是给他添麻烦吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，不是。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「还总是用海星打他。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…这个我无法否认。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「被讨厌也是没有办法的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子…还是不太会和人打交道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「总是想到什么说什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，你才会这么单纯啊…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在心里默默说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听我说，风子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我和他在一起很久了。所以我知道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道他是一个随性的人。并不是讨厌你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我这样安慰她。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":3},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放学后，风子依旧在派发海星，直到太阳落山。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我感觉，今天和风子说话的学生比昨天多了一些。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即便是这样的小事，对我来说也是一种安慰。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu40"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"教学楼里空无一人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"督促学生回家的广播也早已经结束。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可风子依然不停地看着周围，站在那里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想，学生应该都已经回去了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我走近她，这样说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「如果继续留在学校里，就要被老师骂了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以说，我们回去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「…本想再多派发一些出去的，不过也没办法了。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg015y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「仔细想了一想…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「已经很久没有和冈崎同学这样两个人在一起了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「从早上到现在不都是两个人吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「感觉，身体在发警告。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「警告什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「快逃，这个人很危险…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",800],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",800],"value":["+",["+",["+",["+",["+",["+",["+",["v","f",108],["v","f",109]],["v","f",110]],["v","f",111]],["v","f",112]],["v","f",113]],["v","f",114]],["v","f",115]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":80,"condition":["==",["v","f",800],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…啥。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你多心了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「希望如此吧…」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":76,"condition":["==",["v","f",127],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「只不过是在你额头上贴了张纸而已。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「果然是做过啊，真是有点太糟糕了。」"},{"op":"goto","to":79},{"op":"ifFalse","to":79,"condition":["==",["v","f",127],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",148],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":112},{"op":"goto","to":92},{"op":"ifFalse","to":86,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",800],1],["==",["v","f",800],2]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我回想起对陷入妄想的她所做过的恶作剧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「放心，我不会再对你做什么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「真做过啊，真是有点太糟糕了。」"},{"op":"goto","to":92},{"op":"ifFalse","to":92,"condition":[">",["v","f",800],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我回想起对陷入妄想的她所做过的恶作剧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还不止一次两次。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「放心，我不会再对你做什么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「真做过啊，真是有点太糟糕了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等等…什么叫有点太糟糕了啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「怕说太糟糕了冈崎同学会受伤，所以专门创造了一个单词。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「这个的话，就算听到也会觉得很可爱。如何呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…麻烦把太糟糕换掉行吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「这个换不了。已经是口头禅了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你居然能在口头禅前面加别的单词…脑子也太灵活了吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「所以，只加了一个有点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么你把有点换成『自己』吧」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「自己太糟糕了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「…这下变成风子太糟糕了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不行吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「完全不行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「风子一点都不糟糕。糟糕的是冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg012y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":4},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们走着走着，前方有一群学生围在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中一个人看向我们。是一个熟人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「哟，这不是冈崎吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他向我打了声招呼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「你刚才在和谁说话？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谁…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我回头一看。"},{"op":"native","call":["call","global.counter[].start_real",[],["v","counter",7]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",600],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":127,"condition":["<=",["-",1000,300],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","cur_call.l",1],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":128},{"op":"set","target":["v","cur_call.l",1],"value":300},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",600],"value":1000},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",601],"value":["call","global.counter[].get",[],["v","counter",7]]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu19"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":132,"condition":["==",0,0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她一言不发…傻傻地看着我。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「叫你呢，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？哦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的视线一离开风子…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鞋底与地面摩擦的声音响起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等再回过头去。风子已经跑远了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",329],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一把抓住那个男生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你没看见风子在这里吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你看啊，不就在这里吗！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「等一下，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「你说的风子到底是谁…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就是一直和我在一起的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「那个叫古河的女孩吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是…是那个一直在派发木雕的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男学生","text":"「你这么说，我不知道啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他不仅是看不到…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"甚至已经从记忆里消失了…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拼命在派发海星的她…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"学校里应该没人不知道的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我推开那个男生，去追风子。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg033y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":4},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子正小步走在路边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到那小小的背影，我追了上去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说风子…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那家伙说的话，你别在意。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你没事的对吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不是那种容易受伤的人对吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子还是一言不发。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你…最近可能太出风头了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过没关系。还有我和春原在呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不会让人来欺负你的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我简直想象不了，风子失落的样子。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg003y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":3},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「＄渚，我进来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我打开房门，露了个脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚还是躺在被窝里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「回来了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚看着我的脸，报以微笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和风子并坐在她的床头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「身体怎么样。不要一副闷闷不乐的样子哦。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":192,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「＄朋也君，你的说话方式好像我爸爸。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"旁边的风子点了点头，表示同意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我要坐起来一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不要紧吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「一会儿还是可以的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她撑起身子，坐在了床上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「今天学校里有发生什么事情吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没有。和平常一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是吗…那，就好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话题接不下去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚好不容易才坐起来的…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明想多聊点东西，让风子开心一下的…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17e"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":213,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「小风，你喜欢＄朋也君吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「噗…你突然问这个干什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚似乎是察觉到了气氛，抛出一个大炸弹。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子盯着我看了一会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她会怎么回答呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「说话虽然不好听，但不讨人厌。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，那真是谢谢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我很意外。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":257,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是的。虽然说话不好听，但冈崎同学是个很温柔的人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谢谢啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你们两个很合适。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…啥？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学很温柔，小风很可爱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你们两个，很合适。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你在说什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你想把我和风子撮合在一起？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「其实，我是这样想的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我们之间存在着一堵命运之墙，是绝不可能在一起的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「冈崎同学，你说的非常好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总是在奇怪的地方默契。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你们两个果然很般配。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哪里般配了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「所以…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学，小风就拜托了你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她突然低下头，朝我鞠了一躬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你们两个一起去玩，要玩的开心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「小风也不要太紧张，尽情地向冈崎同学撒娇吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「让他紧紧地抱住你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我已经…再也抱不了你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「无论小风再怎么努力，也抱不了你了。」"},{"op":"goto","to":278},{"op":"ifFalse","to":278,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这是我最爱的，男朋友。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你是不是又傻了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但现在我的身体很差，当朋也君的女朋友显得有些笨手笨脚的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「虽然我本来就笨手笨脚的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你到底想说什么啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，小风就拜托了你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她突然低下头，朝我鞠了一躬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「你们两个一起去玩，要玩的开心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「小风也不要太紧张，尽情地向朋也君撒娇吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「让他紧紧地抱住你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我已经…再也抱不了你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「无论小风再怎么努力，也抱不了你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是让我代替她照顾风子吗…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16e"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":286,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「拜托了，＄朋也君。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子爬到我和＄渚之间。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着拉起我和＄渚的手，握在一起。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「你们两位…风子都喜欢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是这样说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和＄渚看着对方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子的温柔…让心里暖成一片。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下一个瞬间…"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":304,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],1]},{"op":"goto","to":305},{"op":"ifFalse","to":305,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和＄渚同时抱住风子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「哇…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吃了一惊的风子拿出海星…"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘭！嘭！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好疼！好疼！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只砸了我一个人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，你刚才不是说不讨厌我的吗！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17e"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":318,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「＄朋也君抱人的手法太色了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你叫我怎么抱啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不要把脸靠过来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不靠过来我怎么抱啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「那个…只是事发突然，被吓到了而已。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「要抱过来的时候，请事先说一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么羞耻的话谁说得出口啊…」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"bg034n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"深夜，我离开古河家，来到了学生宿舍。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，春原，你在的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我怒吼着走进房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你今天为什么没来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说，冈崎。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「风子妹妹，到底是什么人啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原把脸贴在被炉上问到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我直接呆住了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这几天，我一直在调查。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「风子妹妹…伊吹风子，她一直昏迷不醒，睡在医院里…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这是我打听到的消息。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么，和我们在一起的女孩又是谁？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「假的风子吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「如果是假的，也就算了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「但不是吧。因为她…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你有没有发觉？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「她正逐渐被遗忘。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不止是看不见。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「和她说过话的，从她手里接到过手里剑的人…都说不认识她。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「还有人说，她是幽灵。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我能去确认一下吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「确认什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「去到邻镇的医院。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「笨蛋…别去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「为什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不亲眼确认一下，我怎么都放不下心来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果去邻镇的医院，看见了昏迷的风子…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在得知了事实后…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原…是不是也会变得看不见风子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会遗忘掉她的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的脑海里，翻滚着这般恐怖的一幕。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，可以吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会不会和那些男生变得一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"──喂，冈崎，你在和谁说话呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你真烦啊。我不是叫你别去的吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「干什么啊，露出这么恐怖的表情…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没有办法继续待下去，于是我匆匆离开了他的房间。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":1515,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]